{"title":"Golden","artist":"K-POP Demon Hunters","sourceId":"reference:jWi7kZq1ZKOa8022a2oB","sourceHash":"c02a7063ade78f4e4d385aacc9c1e72782db92be94bf7bfaa763a32810838f5b","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":31713313,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":16.1,"end":19.25,"text":"I was a ghost, I was alone","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":19.25,"end":23.81,"text":"어두워진 앞길 속에 (ah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":23.81,"end":28.17,"text":"Given the throne, I didn't know how to believe","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":28.17,"end":30.81,"text":"I was the queen that I'm meant to be (ah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":30.81,"end":34.76,"text":"I lived two lives, tried to play both sides","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":34.76,"end":38.48,"text":"But I couldn't find my own place (oh, oh)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":38.48,"end":42.59,"text":"Called a problem child, 'cause I got too wild","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":42.59,"end":46.87,"text":"But now that's how I'm gettin' paid, 끝없이 on stage","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":46.87,"end":50.7,"text":"I'm done hidin', now I'm shinin'","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":50.7,"end":54.13,"text":"Like I'm born to be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":54.13,"end":58.11,"text":"We dreamin' hard, we came so far","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":58.11,"end":61.51,"text":"Now I believe","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":61.51,"end":65.48,"text":"We're goin' up, up, up, it's our moment","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":65.48,"end":67.3,"text":"You know together we're glowin'","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":67.3,"end":69.15,"text":"Gonna be, gonna be golden","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":69.15,"end":73.15,"text":"Oh, up, up, up with our voices","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":73.15,"end":75.25,"text":"영원히 깨질 수 없는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":75.25,"end":77.05,"text":"Gonna be, gonna be golden","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":77.05,"end":81.98,"text":"Oh, I'm done hidin', now I'm shinin'","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":81.98,"end":85.32,"text":"Like I'm born to be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":85.32,"end":89.22,"text":"Oh, our time, no fears, no lies","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":89.22,"end":95.13,"text":"That's who we're born to be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":95.13,"end":99.18,"text":"Waited so long to break these walls down","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":99.18,"end":103.13,"text":"To wake up and feel like me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":103.13,"end":107.0,"text":"Put these patterns all in the past now","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":107.0,"end":111.72,"text":"And finally live like the girl they all see","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":111.72,"end":115.72999999999999,"text":"No more hidin', I'll be shinin'","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":115.72999999999999,"end":119.28,"text":"Like I'm born to be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":119.28,"end":123.37,"text":"'Cause we are hunters, voices strong","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":123.37,"end":126.85,"text":"And I know I believe","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":126.85,"end":131.0,"text":"We're goin' up, up, up, it's our moment","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":131.0,"end":132.94,"text":"You know together we're glowin'","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3